{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Culture, Myths, and Legends"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Urban Legend"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe detailed facts about events or actions in work and social contexts, in written or spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.  Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le11ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Past Perfect Tense: Unreal Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you talk about the unreal past, you use past tenses to talk about hypothetical situations. You use the Past Perfect tense for unlikely or unreal situations in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure of the Past Perfect tense is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "subject + had + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use it with an If clause to contain the meaning of unreal past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I had known, I would have ...</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "This means you didn't know, but if you did you would have done something different. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the following examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If he had not been so lucky, he would not be employed now."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If she had had the money, she would have paid. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He would have gone after her to demand his money if she hadn't looked so sad."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If she hadn't left so quickly, he would have spoken to her."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Present Perfect Tense and the Past Perfect Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the perfect tenses when you want to talk about events that are connected to another event in some way."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action that happened at an unspecified time in the past. You do not refer to any point in the time when you use the Present Perfect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">have studied </span>German.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You also use the Present Perfect tense to talk about an action that started in the past and continues up to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"strong\">ve just started </span>dinner.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Past Perfect tense to refer to a completed action in the past that happened before another past action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">had studied </span>German before I went to Germany.</span><br/>First: I studied German, <br/>Second: I went to Germany."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She has probably just lost her job, he decided."}, {"type": "example", "content": "After the Depression had started, the woman came to his shop carrying two empty milk bottles."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before he was able to talk to her, she had run out of the store."}, {"type": "example", "content": "After she had walked a block down the street, he followed her."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He had always felt a little guilty at being one of the lucky ones with money and a job."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wordlessly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without speaking"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She wordlessly placed them on the counter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about myths and legends."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "The Depression"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bperiod of \u200beconomic downturn from 1929 until the \u200bstart of the Second World War"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After The Depression had started, the woman came to his shop carrying two empty milk bottles."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "graveyard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where dead people are buried"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: To his surprise, she had headed away from the migrant camp outside of town and toward the graveyard by the river."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gravestone"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a stone with writing on it which marks the place where a person is buried"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was coming from the ground underneath the gravestone where the woman had disappeared!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "casket"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long box used to bury a dead person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When the casket was opened, the store owner saw the woman who had visited his store lying dead within it."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to muffle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a sound quieter and less clear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Then he heard the muffled cry of a baby."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to swarm"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move with a large group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Within minutes, the graveyard was swarming with people"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exchange"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bchange something for something \u200belse of a \u200bsimilar \u200bvalue or \u200btype"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She came again the next morning, and exchanged her empty bottles for full without saying a word."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le11ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "On the internet, research some local urban legends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the urban legend in your own words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your urban legend to a group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the other legends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss which ones you think could be possible."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research urban legends on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an urban legend in my own words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my urban legend aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss urban legends."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le11ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le11ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le11ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "After The Depression had started, the woman came to his shop carrying two empty milk bottles. She wordlessly placed them on the counter. He took the empties and replaced them with full bottles, saying: \"Ten cents, please.\"\nShe did not reply. She took the bottles and left. He would have gone after her to demand his money if she hadn't looked so sad. Her need was in her face, and he had always felt a little guilty at being one of the lucky ones with money and a job. If he had not been so lucky, he would not be employed now. She has probably just lost her job, he decided. If she had had the money, she would have paid.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le11ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "She was back the next day with two empty milk bottles. He replaced them with full bottles and watched as she hurried out the door. If she hadn't left so quickly, he would have spoken to her.\nShe came again the next morning, and exchanged her empty bottles for full without saying a word. He tried to talk to her to ask if she wanted a job. Before he was able to talk to her, she had run out of the store. After she had walked a block down the street, he followed her.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn10le11ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "To his surprise, she had headed away from the migrant camp outside of town and toward the graveyard by the river. She hurried up to a stone marker and then disappeared into the ground. He rubbed his eyes in disbelief. Then, he heard the muffled cry of a baby. It was coming from the ground underneath the gravestone where the woman had disappeared!\nHe phoned the police. Within minutes, the graveyard was swarming with people, and workers started digging up the grave. When the casket was opened, the store owner saw the woman who had visited his store lying dead within it. In her arms, she held a small baby and two full milk bottles. The baby was still alive.", "id": 3, "time": "71000", "image": "engenn10le11ob10re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "